    "detailed_description": "The game takes place in the &quot;Republic of Krasnoslavia&quot; - one of the dimensions in the Polyhedron multiverse and formerly its main hit. It used to be a true paradise for rebels, where people who connected to Krasnoslavia can smash the streets, steal cars, and feel boundless freedom. Nowadays, Krasnoslavia looks quite bleak. It's up to you to fix it, using guns and superpowers that allow you to hack the Polyhedron.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882630/extras/640216163a620fbdf648a97571120712.poster.avif?t=1725867369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882630/extras/640216163a620fbdf648a97571120712.webm?t=1725867369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882630/extras/640216163a620fbdf648a97571120712.mp4?t=1725867369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lots of unique abilities that make the gameplay even more fun and varied</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Forget about an abundance of identical guns, each weapon in the game is unique and created for different situations</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the Eastern European cyberpunk with acid cucumbers and hyper vodka</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A variety of locations and game scenarios - first you are shooting soldiers from 3 guns at the same time, and then the floor turns into lava and a huge duck burns you with a laser from its eyes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A personal curator who will help you, cheer you up and blow your mind with his stories, you won't get rid of him so easily</li></ul>",
